      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So basically the ability to create own nodes that work like subgraphs except you can configure any number of inputs and outputs? (That would get rid of copy+pasting the same public variables everywhere when you e.g. just want to do some simple. but repetitive Math with 2 in- and 1 output)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
