  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-16T15:08:19.715Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not sure if this is already planned as part of sub graphs so I'll put in the request just in case. Graph which is separate from the main graph view that can specify any number of arguments of any types along with return values where you may return more than 1 value. \n\nFunctions could access variables from their parent scope, but may allocate local variables that are hidden from the parent graph.",
